# Lattice QCD Input File
# Quenched SU(3) Wilson gauge action, 8^3 x 16 lattice

-------------------------------
[Lattice]
-------------------------------
nX: 8
nY: 8
nZ: 8
nT: 16

-------------------------------
[Gauge Action]
-------------------------------
Beta: 6.0
Update Method: heatbath
Metropolis Epsilon: 0.2
Start Type: cold

-------------------------------
[Monte Carlo]
-------------------------------
Thermalization Sweeps: 500
Number of Configurations: 100
Sweeps Between Measurements: 10
Overrelaxation Sweeps: 4
Configuration Save Frequency: 10
Save Binary Configs: on
Random Seed: 12345

-------------------------------
[Measurements]
-------------------------------
Measure Wilson Loops: on
Wilson Loop R Max: 4
Wilson Loop T Max: 8
Measure Polyakov: on
Measure Correlators: off
Verbose Output: on

-------------------------------
[Wilson Fermions]
-------------------------------
Kappa: 0.15
Wilson r: 1.0
CG Max Iterations: 1000
CG Tolerance: 1.0e-10
Solver Type: bicgstab

-------------------------------
[HMC]
-------------------------------
MD Steps: 20
MD Step Size: 0.01
HMC Trajectories: 100
